{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_1000_041fuk", "source_sha256": "80b0a8ba548197509407c7c07f59eedb57f0a9fdc68898c7679c545f1e88cc86", "ja": "ふんふんふ～ん♪　……ふふっ♪", "zh": "哼哼哼～♪呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f70fa54d6d8fd44acc235fb3ae58dab0c04d4d61dbede6bb54701634f7151025", "ja": "風花、ここにいたのか。\nずいぶんご機嫌だな。何かいいことでもあったのか？", "zh": "风花，你在这啊。\n感觉你的心情很好，发生了什么好事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5aadff41e568e04171322d68713f79ab33cf246908cfa1b179a357511b6d5e9f", "ja": "あ、はい♪　実はこの前の公演に、看護師時代の同僚が\n来てくれたみたいで。メッセージをくれたんです♪", "zh": "啊，是的♪其实啊，我当护理师时的同事\n好像有来看之前的公演，传了讯息给我呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "546ef264bff4b167dd38596c3eb306408a4d74545e6ce46431dcfd07f666233e", "ja": "『すごく元気が出た、私も病院で頑張るね』って！", "zh": "写说『谢谢你的加油打气，我也会在医院努力的』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6e7fa29312f5a359fe09b0d5c78523f29c75f682431a6f153f590b3860024c88", "ja": "私、アイドルとして、ちゃんと誰かの力に\nなれたんだなって思えて……うれしくて♪", "zh": "我才明白自己作为偶像，\n真的有成功帮助到他人……所以很开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3075c4daf1433fadc3250053faccfaf9cfdfb54c50880aa32b616cbd17c0e6fe", "ja": "そうか……よかったな。風花の公演で、みんなに\n笑顔と元気を届けられたのは、間違いないと思うよ。", "zh": "这样啊……真是太好了。\n我想风花的公演，确实有将笑容还有活力带给了大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_1006_p", "source_sha256": "be021b9d29802904522202960d76a123a9a4d09697c66791dfe74fc618a185cf", "ja": "ブログの反響も大きいし、ファンレターも増えたし。\n風花のこれからに期待が集まってる証拠だな。", "zh": "部落格的回响也很惊人，粉丝信也变多了，\n这些全都代表大家有多期待风花未来的发展呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8e7e3432e030ea49c096b9a250068a562697d0c6044c3b187a1166b082c5cdc2", "ja": "私のこれから……ふふっ♪　それじゃ、次はもっと\n成長した姿を見てもらえるように、がんばりますね♪", "zh": "我的发展……呵呵♪那我得更努力，\n下次让大家看到我的成长呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e37cd1607740e8a1cb2f537c647ea2b2622657b2fc734628e31b0633af2bd573", "ja": "そうだな。もっともっと成長した風花の姿を、\nたくさんの人に見てもらおう！", "zh": "是啊，把风花有所成长、突破的样子，\n让更多的人看见吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a5649230a5edd046e8cfdad1cf2e14b4c992226e4e9fd2733ed2da6387bdc90b", "ja": "……え？　……えっと、{$P$}さん？\nき、気のせいかもしれませんけど……。", "zh": "……咦？……那个，{$P$}先生？\n也、也许是我误会了，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "73f26774a6000a7ec0fdaa44d1ad63f958ebaaa4fa3b53774146f85abaa86e0e", "ja": "今の言い方って、もしかして……。\nまた私に、水着のお仕事とか……来たんですか？", "zh": "听你刚才那样说，该不会……\n又有要穿泳装的工作……找上我了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_1011", "source_sha256": "82407c85126b869be5290e4540314844f8e93db7cedad30c0529f1e5c7797a88", "ja": "（目を逸らす）", "zh": "（移开视线）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_2001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "63433b4a28f1c89040479074979ea537c9b22b2b210638ba3b2afbe4d38d12f3", "ja": "やっぱり～！？　うう、せっかく正統派アイドルらしい\n素敵なステージができたのに……くすん。", "zh": "果然吗～！？呜呜，人家好不容易才像个正统派偶像\n完成了精彩的表演……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_2002_p", "source_sha256": "abad8a95539e7d001abdf06f3d3e7448747782399d2c1e655a1f6ecefbcb4943", "ja": "ち、違う、水着じゃないぞ。グラビアの撮影だけど、\n風花の優しい雰囲気に、とっても似合う仕事なんだ。", "zh": "不、不是泳装啦。虽然是要拍写真照没错，\n但我觉得这份工作非常适合风花的温柔魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_2003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d7166041d1ca28d2d12ee678752508dc1b0dc30fbf2a1f62a7387418e358d318", "ja": "え？　優し……。\nも、もう、{$P$}さんったらっ。", "zh": "咦？温柔……\n讨、讨厌，{$P$}先生真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_2004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6f5cd1292260af4c14146132ba0f7a0e881d890c0f068deedb7a5aa5581f625d", "ja": "そ、そういうことなら……、わかりました。\nそうですよね。お仕事はお仕事、ですよねっ。", "zh": "既、既然是这样……那我明白了。\n说得也是，工作就是工作，哪能挑三拣四的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_2005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "431cae5fa9eb59a598eb18d66dad1c65337e38c50ef8d233b9beaaeac65741e6", "ja": "私もアイドルですから！　これからも、たくさん\nみんなの力になれるように……がんばります♪", "zh": "毕竟我也是偶像嘛！我要继续加油……\n让自己能够更帮助到大家♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_2006_p", "source_sha256": "a0ba11857bf2d5be63628bc1c1a213b491deca48c8eb9087213bed61e58cd517", "ja": "（人に寄り添い、励ます気持ち。……風花の優しさは、\n数枚の写真からも伝わっていくだろう）", "zh": "（风花那份想帮助、鼓励他人的心意……\n就算只是几张照片，肯定也能表现出她的温柔。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_042_2007_p", "source_sha256": "ecc3af83665dbbc21fc2f1880db4ee5c4a009e4eb09936c4373202fb6d84ae14", "ja": "（『風花先生のプライベートレッスン』……。\nよし、企画を進めよう）", "zh": "（『风花老师的私人课程』……\n好，就让这个企划走下去吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
